{
  "note": "The statement a signature would be over. It binds exactly what is neither inside the fingerprint nor recomputable from the artifact's bytes, which is the declared parent and nothing else; the recipe is in docs/contracts/Artifact.md. Nothing here signs anything: this exists so that two independent signature layers agree on what they are signing.",
  "recipe": [
    "b\"nodsig-statement-v1\\x00\"",
    "lp(manifest.format)",
    "raw32(manifest.fingerprint)",
    "u8(build.parent present) || [ lp(parent.format) || raw32(parent.fingerprint) ]",
    "lp(s) = u16be(len(utf8(s))) || utf8(s)",
    "statement = sha256(the above), lowercase hex"
  ],
